# Pressed on the way up the wall, a few ticks before the lip: remembered into the air
# (spine.bufferTicks), the transfer starts once the arc clears the ridge.
park lab
spawn lab_spine_south
cmd 6 speed 7.5
tap revert 148
run 400
expect event spineTransfer within 157..160
expect event land{quality=clean,fakie=false} within 270..290
expect no event bail
